<section class="how-it-works section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center">
      <span class="section__eyebrow">Simple as 1-2-3</span>
      <h2 class="section__title" style="color:var(--navy)">
        Install AirGuard™<br>in 3 Simple Steps
      </h2>
      <p class="section__subtitle">
        No tools. No experience. No problem.
        If you can peel a sticker, you can seal your home.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-grid">

      <div class="step-card" data-animate>
        <div class="step-card__number">1</div>
        <span class="step-card__icon">🧽</span>
        <div class="step-card__title">Clean the Surface</div>
        <div class="step-card__desc">
          Wipe down the area with a dry cloth to remove dust and debris. The cleaner the surface, the stronger the seal.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card" data-animate>
        <div class="step-card__number">2</div>
        <span class="step-card__icon">📦</span>
        <div class="step-card__title">Peel the Backing</div>
        <div class="step-card__desc">
          Peel back the protective liner to reveal the high-strength adhesive. Cut to your desired length with scissors.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card" data-animate>
        <div class="step-card__number">3</div>
        <span class="step-card__icon">✅</span>
        <div class="step-card__title">Press &amp; Seal</div>
        <div class="step-card__desc">
          Press firmly onto the gap or crack. Run your finger along to activate the seal. Done — your home is now protected.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="text-center" style="margin-top:48px" data-animate>
      <p style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:24px">
        👉 "That's it. No tools needed. Seal your entire home in under 10 minutes."
      </p>
      <a href="#product-hero" class="btn btn--primary btn--xl btn--pulse">
        🛒 GET YOURS NOW — 50% OFF
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

